===(Optional) Talk to Paavo{{subst:void|<!--202190131-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Aurum Alley|update|Seems like General Huaiyan is planning to accept the repatriation of the sword while keeping it a secret from his granddaughter Yunli. Even if there's a catch, Yunli would never miss an opportunity to lay her eyes upon the legendary sword.<br />It might be a good idea to learn more about the sword from the envoy involved in the repatriation.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Paavo)
:{{tx}}
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Let's talk about Kalevala.
:::'''Paavo:''' Oh, you're interested in my home planet? That's great! Your Excellency is welcome to visit us at any time.
:::{{tx}}
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Let's talk about the sword.
:::'''Paavo:''' Oh, you mean the Miekka Kivessä! It's an incredible sword. That weapon helped the legendary heroes of my homeland slay demons and is highly revered.
:::'''Paavo:''' It also has the power to choose monarchs. All the ancient kings of Kalevala received a sign from the sword, showing they were worthy to rule the land.
:::'''Paavo:''' According to tradition, each monarch would plunge the sword into a stone, and only a hero recognized by the sword could pull it out and ascend to the throne next.
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is it some sort of biometric technology?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That sword can actually appoint worthy monarchs?
:::'''Paavo:''' Well, those are just legends from the past. No one today has witnessed it firsthand.
:::{{tx}}
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why don't you keep the sword for yourselves?
:::'''Paavo:''' Well, times have changed, and now that we have a council in place, the idea of a sword crowning a king has become a joke. Besides, {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|it wasn't a native of Kalevala who last pulled out the sword and recognized its connection to the Xianzhou ship &mdash; it was a visitor from afar.}}
:::{{tx}}
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} I'm going to witness its return, too.
:::'''Paavo:''' Wonderful! It's an honor to have so many people witness the sword's homecoming.
:::{{tx}}
:'''Paavo:''' Wonderful! It's an honor to have so many people witness the sword's homecoming.

;(Talk to Xikui)
:'''Xikui:''' General Huaiyan will hold the sword-gifting ceremony at the Palace of Astrum soon. Are you interested, (Trailblazer)?
{{Dialogue End}}

