===Find Yunli at Master Gongshu's aurumaton storehouse{{subst:void|<!--202190108-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Artisanship Commission|update|Who would've expected Yunli to call the repatriated sword a cursed sword, in the presence of her grandfather and guests, no less... She's lucky her objection could be downplayed as the harmless words of a child, though the tongue-lashing from General Huaiyan clearly left her indignant.<br />Storming over to the Artisanship Commission with a giant sword in tow, she'll only scare everyone else on her way! Help Master Gongshu put an end to this frenzy now!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Yunli:''' What are you doing here? Look, if I get into trouble, it's my problem. I don't want to drag you into it.
