:'''Yunli:''' This place is heavily guarded, but... there's nothing but aurumatons. Where is the arsenal...?
:'''Yunli:''' Seems like not even those craftsmen know where the arsenal is... At this rate, we won't find anything, and Grandpa might take me away before I can do anything...
:'''Yunli:''' ...You're not really here to help me. You're here to stop me, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Of course I'm here to stop you. I can't just stand there and watch you get into trouble.
